  "helpSavingSteps": "Budget the amount, for example 500 in Stocks & ETFs.\nAdd a transfer from your budget account (for example checking) to the brokerage or savings account.\nPick Stocks & ETFs as its category. The category is spent, the brokerage account grows, and To Be Budgeted stays the same.\nGains, dividends and fees inside the brokerage account need no category.",
