    "description": "Help topic text"
  },
  "helpTbbSteps": "Negative means you budgeted more than you have: lower a category until it is back at zero.\nWhat is left at the end of a month carries over to the next month, where you can budget it.\nAccounts outside the budget, like savings or a brokerage account, do not count here.",
